  openedCoverSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9f6ef615ea10cf47acc9940bde21fa6, type: 3}
  BookText: 'To all you kind citizen of Virrihael,


    The Curch runs everyday
    without any financial aid from anyone. We are commited to pray to the Gods, for
    us and for you as well.


    However, we also have to eat, we also feel the
    thirst.


    Recently we''ve been on a shortage of coin and food, we''re not
    asking for your well deserved gold, but we could use some Wheat. If you''re generous
    enough, please help your Curch.


    Father Lucien.'
  CantBeTaken: 0
  isNoteOrScroll: 1
